# Project NoéMI - .gatekeeper/ directory
#
# Purpose
# -------
# This directory holds Gatekeeper deployment state: signed HMAC handshake
# evidence, per-fork enforcement markers (e.g., branch-protection-enforced
# stamps), and ephemeral verification artifacts emitted by the
# `gatekeeper-deployment` reference stack. Contents are tenant-specific and
# must NEVER be committed to the reference architecture.
#
# This `.gitignore` keeps the directory tracked (so persona specifications
# and orchestrators that reference `.gatekeeper/` resolve to a real path)
# while excluding the runtime state itself.
#
# Decision reference: docs/DECISION_LOG.md → [2026-05-28-0002]

# Ignore everything in this directory...
*
# ...except this file (so the directory stays tracked).
!.gitignore
